      "value": "Sorry but this is just a baiting vote first of all just a small community make use of that camera for shaders (which btw was disabled anyway and you just exploited it) and a much bigger community strike terror with that so all you guys did was typing it to everybody you know and every discord and told them to \"upvote this shit pls\" regardless if they don't even understand what they miss out which you can also take from the comments here secondly your statement is written like we talk about the ingame camera and not the actual unity component (which still was never to be more than local anyway) and lastly you can still friend people you wanna show it to them but instead you go rampage because you need confirmation in your life I bet 100 bucks if they would implement a button to activate/deactivate this and it would be disabled by default you would still rampage.",
