      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "value": "There's no reason you should be limiting cameras to friends only. You ought to be able to force cameras to not render to display 1 at runtime, and other than that cameras are not so much of a security issue. Also, people with high-resolution cameras on their avatars will still cause performance issues for their friends. You really should of just enforced cameras not writing to display 1 and added a checkbox to the menu to turn on and off cameras globally.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
